# Context

## Background
V0.10.2 (rules_v0102_bigboard.json) was declared the final design,
so ten experiment generations of artifacts were reorganized or removed.

## Why This Way
- Rules variants moved, not deleted: engine tests still replay them
  as regression checks, and DECISIONS.md cites them as history.
- results/ keeps only v10-level2, v10-prestige, v10-six-blocks: the
  direct evidence for the final rules. All older results, narr1-8,
  v04 tournament runs, and tournaments/ live in git history only;
  conclusions survive in docs/findings/, notes/, and DECISIONS.md.
- run_programme FROZEN_SOURCES hashes were preserved because file
  contents are untouched; only paths changed.

## Gotchas
- Historical prose (DECISIONS.md, notes, findings) still names rules
  files by their pre-cleanup root paths. The files now live under
  experiments/rules/.
- tools/v10_six_blocks.py writes new arms into experiments/rules/,
  not the repo root.
- test_table_seat pins the recorded win of the kept 0.10.2 table
  game; deleting that run breaks the suite.
